<p><strong>In the given figure, AB || CD, then which one of the following is true?</strong>
    (a) p + q - r = 180°
    (b) p + q + r = 180°
    (c) p - q + r = 180°
    (d) p + q - 2r = 180°</p>
<p><strong>Solution Matrix:</strong>
