<p><strong>Solution 48:</strong>
First, create the cumulative frequency table.
Total frequency (N) = 100.
N/2 = 100/2 = 50.
Given median life = 20 h. This means the median class is 18-23.</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th style="text-align: left;">Life of bulbs (in h)</th>
