<p>Median = L + [((N/2) - C) / f] * h
14.4 = 12 + [(10 - (4 + x)) / 5] * 6
14.4 - 12 = [(10 - 4 - x) / 5] * 6
2.4 = [(6 - x) / 5] * 6
2.4 * 5 = (6 - x) * 6
12 = (6 - x) * 6
12 / 6 = 6 - x
2 = 6 - x
x = 6 - 2
x = 4</p>
